  "description": "<p><em>Artefact (a tome).</em> A good creature who reads it for a week gains 2 Wisdom (up to 22, past the Mortal Limit). After that, a good holder has <strong>Advantage</strong> on saves against evil effects and <strong>once per day</strong> may cast <em>dispel alignment</em> or <em>holy aura</em>.</p><p><strong>Drawback:</strong> an evil creature who touches it takes <strong>5d10</strong> radiant damage.</p><p><strong>Destroyed:</strong> torn apart by a fiend of the highest rank, in its own realm.</p><p class=\"arn-note\">Monsters &amp; Treasure, Artefacts. Its save DC is 20 unless the entry says otherwise.</p>",
